  "historicalArtifactsUntouched": true,
  "resolutions": [
    "Win32 namespace/type conversion and BSTR API differences were fixed before acceptance. No lint allowance was added.",
    "The owned bitmap fixture used an incompatible temporary DC. Raw owned bitmap storage now compares exactly without a screen DC. The hidden RichEdit and password control pass real UIA reads independently and in the serial suite.",
    "The initial native profile required its real first-run acknowledgement. Shelf reads use an active owned island, preserving the existing authorization boundary. Final native review waits for both image inspections and an enabled explicit Run button; no loading-state screenshot is accepted.",
    "The new context batch read required an explicit Shelf unit/mock IPC fixture and a known read-only command in the island screenshot allowlist; unknown commands still fail.",
    "Text menu Escape returns focus to its triggering group/row; outside pointer dismissal preserves the new target focus. Selected video URLs offer Save first.",
    "Image preset loading now gates Run and retains explicit size edits made before preferences arrive; the incoming format and saved quality pass tests.",
    "Default full-document axe found a light-theme selected-text heading contrast failure. Shared text tokens fix it without disabling rules.",
    "The tray host constrains the 480px design row to 442px. Main menu remains280x348, case submenu200x190, and original 14px/16px SVGs retain their geometry.",
    "NSIS/MSI fixture compilation required a valid main component GUID/keypath and read-only COM table extraction. The final compile-only fixture has no warning and proves cleanup before RemoveFiles; no installer was run.",
    "A preliminary release build without custom-protocol was interrupted. Only the completed custom-protocol build and matching embedded manifest/native captures are authoritative."
  ]
}
